33":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":1796},{"id":"72157663453672647","position":27}],"bytes":12374600,"camera_position":1796,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0029.json","filename":"14666578633_8397d4ce60_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/14666578633/","height":3000,"id":"14666578633","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/14666578633/14666578633_8397d4ce60_o.jpg","sha256":"4366ac4e7de819fe834ff6a6e4b4d1b131bccb5af06b820ba8e7ae6d4eb75da0","tags":[],"taken":"2014-06-18 16:13:45","title":"IMG_4443","uploaded":"2014-07-13 13:24:24","width":4000},"14666588243":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643906917753","position":4},{"id":"72157643908329683","position":2},{"id":"72157643911711523","position":1792}],"bytes":5448809,"camera_position":1792,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0029.json","filename":"14666588243_11d2aae28e_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/14666588243/","height":2610,"id":"14666588243","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/14666588243/14666588243_11d2aae28e_o.jpg","sha256":"2b340f44c625fa0acb04ec2551e834b5e56b66973c83917a3f4834c125546b22","tags":[],"taken":"2014-06-18 14:04:50","title":"IMG_4414","uploaded":"2014-07-13 13:25:44","width":1903},"14666592223":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":1791}],"bytes":11343253,"camera_position":1791,"comments":[{"author":"46922780@N00","date":"2014-07-13 16:26:02","text":"nice balance - it can be really hard getting mixed shade forest shots to turn out well."},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2014-07-13 16:29:11","text":"It definitely can be tough.  Parc Des Braves in Qu\u00e9bec City creates a lot of scenes like this and it took a lot of shots over a number of days before one looked ok."},{"author":"46922780@N00","date":"2014-07-13 16:41:15","text":"Judging by shadows it was early or late in the day - having softer light really helps."},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2014-07-13 16:43:52","text":"Almost all of my shots of Parc Des Braves were early in the morning.  There is something especially hard to capture about a brilliant green and a sunny sky.  Both the Canon G15 and the 5D have a similar difficulty.  It would be fun to try a lot of cameras with the same conditions."},{"author":"92599451@N08","date":"2014-07-25 04:28:35","text":"now this I like looks a very pleasant place for a walk,"}],"description":"","detail":"photos/0029.json","filename":"14666592223_f2c97a9b9f_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/14666592223/","height":2227,"id":"14666592223","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/14666592223/14666592223_f2c97a9b9f_o.jpg","sha256":"40214d91cccd7227014d6c27e08e68015c5423719818c0db48b36d5d8af6efcb","tags":[],"taken":"2014-06-17 05:30:57","title":"IMG_4389","uploaded":"2014-07-13 13:26:15","width":3752},"14668948961":{"albums":[{"id":"72157639560694166","position":20},{"id":"72157643911711523","position":1832}],"bytes":9787501,"camera_position":1832,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0029.json","filename":"14668948961_1e97c00ea0_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/14668948961/","height":4000,"id":"14668948961","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/14668948961/14668948961_1e97c00ea0_o.jpg","sha256":"5286cbb202b50df16410646faa7f0b4c2a48a930be00af5495639195b2a1e869","tags":["architecture","Que\u0301bec"],"taken":"2014-06-22 17:42:13","title":"IMG_4705","uploaded":"2014-07-16 14:27:16","width":3000},"14670430203":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":1813}],"bytes":2535099,"camera_position":1813,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0029.json","filename":"14670430203_7e2ee6f962_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/14670430203/","height":979,"id":"14670430203","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"original